## Authentication

All authentication is handled via `Authenticator` implementations passed to the client constructor.

### Bearer Token

```go file
import (
	"{{packageName}}/pkg"
	"{{packageName}}/pkg/auth"
)

func newClient() (*{{packageName}}.Client, error) {
	authenticator, err := auth.NewBearerAuthenticator("https://api.example.com", "your-token")
	if err != nil {
		return nil, err
	}
	return {{packageName}}.New{{clientClassName}}(authenticator, nil), nil
}
```

