### OAuth2 Implicit

The implicit flow obtains the access token out of band (typically in the browser). Pass the token to the authenticator:

```go file
import (
	"{{packageName}}/pkg"
	"{{packageName}}/pkg/auth/oauth"
)

func newClient() (*{{packageName}}.Client, error) {
	authenticator := oauth.NewOAuth2ImplicitAuthenticator(
		"https://api.example.com", "client-id", "https://auth.example.com/authorize", nil)
	if err := authenticator.SetAccessToken("your-access-token"); err != nil {
		return nil, err
	}
	return {{packageName}}.New{{clientClassName}}(authenticator, nil), nil
}
```

